silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_10_trace_leg_concrete_anchor#audittrail_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The AuditTrail_77 is AuditTrail_77: the W3C PROV-O audit log for VetRecord_77; records all creation, modification, and access events for VetRecord_77 at Tartu Animal Clinic; append-only; distinct from VetRecord_77 and from SHACLPassReport_77." .
