silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_10_trace_leg_concrete_anchor#tracearrow_audit silm:hasLongDescription "The TraceArrow_Audit is TraceArrow_Audit: the typed arrow AuditTrail_77 -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from record_leg (VetRecord_77 -> MittensColimitApex) and validation_leg (SHACLPassReport_77 -> MittensColimitApex). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'trace_leg', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
