silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_10_trace_leg_concrete_anchor#prov_o_activity silm:hasLongDescription "The PROV_O_Activity is PROV_O_Activity: the W3C PROV-O activity type; AuditTrail_77 entries are typed as PROV-O activities; the provenance ontology authority for audit trail entries. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ProvenanceAuthority', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
